{"unit_id":"sharewiner__dsh-model-management#card-zh","repo":"sharewiner/dsh-model-management","commit":"09db30228b428c3a2cb5e1cf40b9037f0e991ccb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Model Management（DSH Web 插件）：集中选择默认模型并管理模型可见性。它提供模型管理设置，可隐藏单个模型或关闭 Provider，同步影响输入框选择器和 /model 命令，并保留当前选中模型。它还注册 OpenAI Responses 联网搜索 Provider，让搜索跟随默认模型。适合整理模型列表或统一模型路由；使用联网搜索需配置 Provider 与凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:125-187","lib/index.js:20-47","lib/openai-responses-search.js:62-89"]}
